A personal multi-host agent workbench for continuing sessions, jobs, and approvals across devices

Usage: metis [COMMAND]

Commands:
  host  Run a persistent Host without opening the workbench
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
